CoreLane red evidence
=====================
The foundation files (contracts.go, dyn.go, js.go, message_text.go, budget.go, paging.go, files.go, ...) had to land
as real code first (every other lane compiles against them), so the lane's own twins were first run against an EMPTY
extension: the original stub `newPosthorse(policyReader) *sdk.Extension { return sdk.New("posthorse") }` registering
nothing, with every other lane's production code unchanged (container copy only; the shared tree was not touched).
